      "created_at": "2012-05-21T22:34:16.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n      <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/e/e7081d7feab7e4f932fe2289620b2574b84cafaa.jpeg\" class=\"site-icon\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">\n      <a href=\"http://battleshippretension.com/episode-213-superheroes/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"09:59AM - 19 April 2011\">Battleship Pretension – 19 Apr 11</a>\n  </header>\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <div class=\"aspect-image\" style=\"--aspect-ratio:600/400;\"><img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/4/47eb6ebb6f5ebd4eaf99229cb38d61ffba7cecc2.jpeg\" class=\"thumbnail\" width=\"600\" height=\"400\"></div>\n\n<h3><a href=\"http://battleshippretension.com/episode-213-superheroes/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">EPISODE 213: SUPERHEROES! - Battleship Pretension</a></h3>\n\n<p>In this episode, Tyler and David are joined by artist Adam Rebottaro to discuss what superheroes say about America. Related Posts:Episode 724: Jason's Top Ten MoviesEpisode 716: Winter Movie PreviewEpisode 720: Chadwick BosemanEpisode 718: Christmas...</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n",
